2775	/**
2776	 * The major version out of a `--version` line, or "" when there isn't one.
2777	 *
2778	 * Handles the shapes real programs actually print: `v20.11.1` (node),
2779	 * `Python 3.11.2`, `ruby 3.1.4p223`, `PHP 8.2.7 (cli)`, `go version go1.21.5`.
