3266	/**
3267	 * Parse the stale-reference sweep's tab-delimited output.
3268	 *
3269	 * TWO defects from the 2026-07-26 rehearsal live here, and the second is the
3270	 * reason this is a named, tested function instead of an inline loop:
3271	 *
3272	 *  1. It read `clean(out.stdout).split("\n")`, and `clean` deletes tabs. The very
3273	 *     next statement was `raw.indexOf("\t") < 0 → continue`, so EVERY line was
