121	 *
122	 * `local` marks a reference with NO registry host and no Docker-Hub-library shape
123	 * (e.g. `studionexis/frontend:latest`) — the classic locally-BUILT tag that does
124	 * not exist in any public registry. Those images cannot be pulled on the new
125	 * server, so the migration has to `docker save | gzip` → `gunzip | docker load`
126	 * them across; without that, standalone containers silently never come up (the
127	 * exact failure a real run hit).
128	 *
129	 * Sizes come from `docker images`, which reports each image's FULL size (shared
130	 * layers counted once per image), so the total is a deliberate OVER-estimate —
